CHAPTER.VERS:
No meal-offering, which you

          {+}
         will offer to Yahweh, will be made with leaven; for you

          {+}
         will burn no leaven, nor any honey, as an offering made by fire to Yahweh.

As an oblation of first [fruits] you

          {+}
         will offer them to Yahweh: but they will not come up for a sweet savor on the altar.
